!!HE-1&y1=5:C0/y2/?y5/d0; [Store TYPE of monsters found in hero's army slot y2 in y5]
!!IF&y1=5/y4=0:M^It's a TRAP! Deadly poison darts fly out, but luckily they all miss and nobody is injured.^;
